    IF `the company has complied with subsection (1)` AND `the Registrar has issued a notice of incorporation altered accordingly` AND `the date asked` AT LEAST `the day the notice was issued`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "On compliance by a company with subsection (1) ... and on the issue of a notice of incorporation altered accordingly the company becomes a private company" (a status gated by "On": the periods ruling of 2026-11-05, items (b) and (c); fork line F-I11)

