      `the person is the company, or an officer of the company who is in default` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE Penalty
`s 32(6) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` MEANS
    IF `s 32(6) the person is guilty of the offence` `default is made in complying with subsection (3)(c)` `the person is the company, or an officer of the company who is in default` EQUALS JUST TRUE
    THEN JUST (Penalty OF 2000, 0, FALSE, TRUE)   -- a fine not exceeding $2,000 "and also to a default penalty"; no imprisonment
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the subsection states a penalty only for a person it makes guilty

-- (8): "Where default is made in relation to a private company in complying with any restriction or limitation of a kind specified in section 18(1) that is included, or deemed to be included, in the constitution of the company, the company and every officer of the company who is in default shall be guilty of an offence and shall be liable on conviction to a fine not exceeding $5,000 or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding 12 months."
-- src:5627 | (8) Where default is made in relation to a private company in
-- src:5628 | complying with any restriction or limitation of a kind specified in
-- src:5629 | section 18(1) that is included, or deemed to be included, in the
-- src:5630 | constitution of the company, the company and every officer of the
-- src:5631 | company who is in default shall be guilty of an offence and shall be
-- src:5632 | liable on conviction to a fine not exceeding $5,000 or to
-- src:5633 | imprisonment for a term not exceeding 12 months.
@ref s 32(8) (src:5627-5633)
GIVEN `default is made in relation to a private company in complying with a restriction or limitation of a kind specified in section 18(1) that is included or deemed to be included in its constitution` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is the company, or an officer of the company who is in default` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 32(8) the person is guilty of the offence` MEANS
    IF `default is made in relation to a private company in complying with a restriction or limitation of a kind specified in section 18(1) that is included or deemed to be included in its constitution` AND `the person is the company, or an officer of the company who is in default`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Where default is made ..., the company and every officer of the company who is in default shall be guilty of an offence" (the provision's own question; split site (i), fork line F-I10)

-- src:5627 | (8) Where default is made in relation to a private company in
-- src:5628 | complying with any restriction or limitation of a kind specified in
-- src:5629 | section 18(1) that is included, or deemed to be included, in the
-- src:5630 | constitution of the company, the company and every officer of the
-- src:5631 | company who is in default shall be guilty of an offence and shall be
-- src:5632 | liable on conviction to a fine not exceeding $5,000 or to
-- src:5633 | imprisonment for a term not exceeding 12 months.
@ref s 32(8) (src:5627-5633)
GIVEN `default is made in relation to a private company in complying with a restriction or limitation of a kind specified in section 18(1) that is included or deemed to be included in its constitution` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is the company, or an officer of the company who is in default` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE Penalty
`s 32(8) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` MEANS
    IF `s 32(8) the person is guilty of the offence` `default is made in relation to a private company in complying with a restriction or limitation of a kind specified in section 18(1) that is included or deemed to be included in its constitution` `the person is the company, or an officer of the company who is in default` EQUALS JUST TRUE
    THEN JUST (Penalty OF 5000, 12, FALSE, FALSE)   -- a fine not exceeding $5,000 "or" imprisonment not exceeding 12 months: not both, and no default penalty
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the subsection states a penalty only for a person it makes guilty
